# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to ignore these files since the code is intended to run in multiple environments; otherwise, check them in:
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, if you're building an app rather than a library, you should commit it.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock should be committed in applications.
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock should be committed in applications.
